                "title": "Sandcast Bronze Yuma Lever with Square Rose",
                "description": "The Sandcast Bronze Yuma Lever with Square Rose is a uniquely modern leverset that utilizes a sleek design with all the charms that are associated with a sandcast piece. Since it is made of sandcast bronze, each piece is different where the mold had its own characteristics and these details give it a rustic feel that accentuates it's beauty. The Yuma Leverset with #6 Square Rose is available in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n",
                "keywords": "EMT-7061YM, Sandcast Bronze Yuma Lever with Square Roses, Emtek 7061YM, Emtek 7111YM, Emtek 7211YM, Yuma Lever with #6 Rosettes, Contemporary Yuma Leverset with Square Roses, Yuma Leverset with #6 Square Roses, Yuma Door Lever with Square Roses,"
